{"deck": "kayfabizzaro_politics", "coverOffset": 1, "cards": [{"quad": 0, "n": 1, "page": 2, "text": ["THE CITY-STATE", "[R: 8] [A: 6] [F: 2]", "Aristotle called us political", "animals. He meant it as a", "compliment. We have comp-", "licated the assessment.", "POWER", "Ostracism: Exile any player", "who becomes too powerful.", "The audience talks back."]}, {"n": 2, "page": 2, "quad": 1, "text": ["THE CAESAR", "[R: 5] [A: 10] [F: 9]", "The Republic survived the", "crossing. The political reality", "did not.", "POWER", "The Worked Shoot: Violate", "the constitution publicly.", "Generals must disband", "BLÖDSINN!", "armies; you kept yours."]}, {"page": 2, "n": 3, "quad": 2, "text": ["THE MACHIAVELLI", "[R: 9] [A: 4] [F: 3]", "Everyone sees what you", "appear to be; few experience", "what you really are.", "POWER:", "The Prince: Perform virtue", "while doing the terrible thing.", "Do it all at once."]}, {"quad": 3, "text": ["THE BISMARCK", "[R: 4] [A: 9] [F: 8]", "Give them the performance", "of representation and they", "won't notice the absence", "of substance.", "POWER:", "Realpolitik: The election", "is theater.", "You are the machinery.", "GW Georg w Westphalen"], "n": 4, "page": 2}, {"quad": 0, "text": ["THE POPULIST", "[R: 10] [A: 2] [F: 6]", "I alone can fix it. The", "institutions are the enemy.", "You are with me or you are", "with them.", "POWER", "The Rally: Convert every", "action into a performance.", "Reality checks require a", "BLÖDSINN! roll."], "n": 5, "page": 3}, {"quad": 1, "text": ["THE EXPERT", "[R: 2] [A: 8] [F: 1]", "The data suggests your", "anger is statistically", "insignificant.", "anial", "POWER", "The Briefing: Establish", "expertise. Your next action", "cannot be challenged on", "facts, only on tone."], "n": 6, "page": 3}, {"n": 7, "page": 3, "quad": 2, "text": ["THE TALLEYRAND", "[R: 6] [A: 5] [F: 10]", "I have served under seven", "Prime Ministers. I Intend to", "serve under several more.", "POWER:", "Institutional Memory:", "Reactivate a played card at", "half strength. You know", "where the bodies are buried."]}, {"page": 3, "quad": 3, "text": ["CHANGE", "THE BELIEVER", "NOW!", "[R: 8] [A: 1] [F: 0]", "This is worth doing even if", "it costs me everything.", "(Spoiler: It will).", "KayfaBINGO!", "POWER:", "Conviction: Your narrative", "cannot be redirected. You", "hold the line until you", "burn out.", "Georg v. Westphalen", "GW"], "n": 8}, {"quad": 0, "n": 9, "page": 4, "text": ["THE HANDLER", "[R: 5] [A: 9] [F: 7]", "\"I'm going to need you to", "make some calls.", "No, different calls.\"", "Power", "The Network: Connect", "any two cards.", "Resolve a problem", "immediately without a roll."]}, {"n": 10, "page": 4, "text": ["THE NARRATIVE MANAGER [R: 10] [A: 3] [F: 2]", "\"It's not a lie. It's a", "curated sequence of", "factual elementsiẠạẠỊ", "Power", "The Line to Take:", "Pre-narrate the response", "to a disaster.", "+1 Defense against reality."], "quad": 1}, {"n": 11, "quad": 2, "page": 4, "text": ["THE PERMANENT SECRETARY", "[R: 1] [A: 10] [F: 5]", "\"Ministers come and go.", "We remain.\"", "Power", "The Briefing Pack:", "Add a 'Consideration' to", "any action.", "DENIED", "Three Considerations make", "action impossible."]}, {"n": 12, "page": 4, "text": ["THE ACCESS", "[R: 0] [A: 10] [F: 10]", "\"I didn\"t buy the politician.", "I invested in a shared", "value system.\"", "Power", "KayfaBIZARRO!", "The Invisible Hand:", "Amplify a card's effect.", "The access is invisible;", "the results are real.", "GW Georg w Westphalen"], "quad": 3}, {"page": 5, "quad": 0, "text": ["THE GRANDIOSE", "[R:9] [A:1] [F:5]", "Lore:", "\"It's not a disorder if it wins", "electionsiẠạồỊi", "Power:", "The Mirror: You must begin", "every turn talking about", "yourself. If accepted, +1 Power."], "n": 13}, {"quad": 1, "page": 5, "text": ["THE STRATEGIST", "[R:8] [A:8] [F:4]", "Lore:", "Have no fixed position. Have", "no genuine belief. Win.", "Power:", "The Frame: Reframe a failure", "as a strategic necessity.", "Can only be blocked by", "checking Plausibility."], "n": 14}, {"quad": 2, "page": 5, "text": ["THE COLD HEART", "[R: 4] [A: 10] [F: 9]", "Lore:", "Stress immunity is a leadership", "asset. So is lack of empathy.", "Power:", "No Brakes: Immune to", "emotional appeals. Can only be", "stopped by mechanics, not", "morals."], "n": 15}, {"n": 16, "text": ["ITEM: THE ECHO CHAMBER", "[Item Card]", "Lore:", "The audience believes the", "performance. The performer", "believes the audience.", "Power:", "Stay", "Feedback Loop: Double the", "fluffy!", "effect of any Narcissist card.", "GW Georg x. Westphalen"], "page": 5, "quad": 3}, {"text": ["DISTRACTION TACTIC", "[Instant Action]", "Lore:", "If you are losing the argument,", "throw a dead cat on the table.", "Now everyone is talking about", "the cat.", "Power:", "Shock Value: Suspend the", "current losing narrative. Force", "everyone to address the Cat."], "n": 17, "page": 6, "quad": 0}, {"quad": 1, "n": 18, "page": 6, "text": ["DIVISION TACTIC", "[Attack]", "Lore:", "Make them choose between", "their values and their friends.", "Power:", "Split Vote: Break an alliance", "between two other cards. They", "must operate independently.", "•"]}, {"page": 6, "text": ["INFORMATION TACTIC", "[Stealth]", "Lore:", "Trial balloon? Hostile disclosure?", "It's not gossip if it's anonymous.", "Power:", "Deniability: Play face down.", "Reveal information later. The", "source is never identified."], "n": 19, "quad": 2}, {"text": ["EVASION TACTIC", "[Defense]", "POOF", "Lore:", "T'm glad you asked that", "question, because the real", "issue is...'", "Power:", "What the", "Redirection: Reduce the", "FLUFF?!", "effect of a negative card by", "50% and change the topic.", "GW", "Georg v. Westphalen"], "page": 6, "n": 20, "quad": 3}, {"text": ["THE LAWYER'S EDIT", "NO", "[Defense]", "\"I did not do \"that\" specific", "thing, in \"that® specific way.*", "Technicality: Negate an", "accusation based on wording,", "not substance."], "page": 7, "quad": 0, "n": 21}, {"page": 7, "text": ["THE BRIDGE", "MMA NƯƯGL", "[Rhetoric]", "\"Let me be very clear about my", "position (without stating the", "position)ạỊạ", "Fill Time: Consume an", "opponent's turn without giving", "them anything to attack."], "n": 22, "quad": 1}, {"page": 7, "quad": 2, "n": 23, "text": ["THE REGULATION", "[Utility]", "Lore:", "\"It follows the letter of the", "law while violating its", "spirit entirely.\"", "Power:", "Escape: Bypass a restriction", "or rule for one turn."]}, {"quad": 3, "page": 7, "text": ["THE SHUTDOWN", "[Ultimate]", "Lore:", "\"If the legislature is", "annoying you, send them", "home.'", "Power:", "Suspension: Remove the", "'Parliament' deck from play", "The real", "for one round.", "issue is...", "KayfaBONGO!", "Georg v. Westphalen", "GW"], "n": 24}, {"n": 25, "text": ["THE PHOTO OP", "[Charisma]", "Lore:", "Kiss the baby. Ignore the", "diaper. Smile for the", "camera.", "Power:", "Authenticity: Connect with", "the \"common voter.\"", "Immune to BLÖDSINN!", "checks this turn."], "page": 8, "quad": 0}, {"page": 8, "text": ["THE BARNSTORM", "[Logistics]", "AO VOTETE", "Lore:", "Spontaneity is organized.", "The organization is invisible.", "VOTE", "Power:", "Momentum: If you keep", "moving, they can't ask", "questions."], "quad": 1, "n": 26}, {"text": ["THE SHOWDOWN", "[Combat]", "08:00", "Lore:", "\"It's not about policy. It's", "about who sighs louder.\"", "Power:", "Soundbite: Win the round", "by being Persuasive, not", "Accurate."], "page": 8, "quad": 2, "n": 27}, {"text": ["THE KNOCK", "[Labor]", "Lore:", "\"Twitter isn't real life.", "This is real life.\"", "Power:", "Turnout: Add +1 to any", "KayfaBOGGLE!", "die roll through sheer", "volume of labor.", "ese:", "GW", "Georg v. Westphalen"], "quad": 3, "n": 28, "page": 8}, {"page": 9, "text": ["THE DELAY", "[Stamina]", "Lore:", "POT LIQUOB", "RECIPES", "\"I will read this recipe for", "pot liquor until you give", "upẠỊạ", "Power:", "Obstruction: No cards can", "be played while the", "Filibuster is active."], "quad": 0, "n": 29}, {"n": 30, "text": ["THE REGICIDE", "[Attack]", "Lore:", "\"We do not believe this", "government should", "continue.®", "Power:", "Vote: Force a majority", "vote. If lost, the", "current Leader is", "suspended."], "quad": 1, "page": 9}, {"page": 9, "n": 31, "quad": 2, "text": ["THE COUNT", "00:00|", "[Procedure]", "Lore:", "CHIRP!", "\"Stop what you are doing", "and prove you existỊẠại", "Power:", "Disruption: Cancel an", "opponent's action by", "demanding a headcount."]}, {"page": 9, "quad": 3, "n": 32, "text": ["PAPERWORK", "[Volume]", "ENEN", "Lore:", "МЕНО", "ẠỌ¿e have a few thousand", "minor suggestions.\"", "Power:", "HUMBUG!", "Overload: Bury an action", "in so much process it", "essentially dies.", "GW Georg w Westphalen"]}, {"page": 10, "quad": 0, "n": 33, "text": ["THE EMERGENCY", "[Global Event]", "Lore:", "Never let a good", "crisis go to waste.", "Who benefits?", "Power:", "Forced Position: No", "neutrality allowed.", "You must declare a", "side or lose power."]}, {"quad": 1, "n": 34, "text": ["THE COMMISSION", "[Delay]", "Lore:", "We will report in 18", "months. By then,", "everyone will have", "forgotten.", "Power:", "Freeze: All cards on", "stage are frozen", "ÇBLÖDSINN!", "until a \"Finding®", "is narrated."], "page": 10}, {"quad": 2, "page": 10, "n": 35, "text": ["THE MARRIAGE", "Binding", "Lore:", "We agree on nothing.", "We are governing", "together.", "Power:", "Joint Custody: Two", "players must", "narrate every move", "together. If they", "disagree, it fails."]}, {"text": ["THE REVEAL", "[Damage]", "Lore:", "The scandal isn't", "what they did. It's", "the hypocrisy.", "Power:", "Silence: The affected", "player cannot", "speak directly; they", "must use a", "'Spokesperson'.", "Georg v. Westphalen", "J", "GW"], "page": 10, "quad": 3, "n": 36}, {"page": 11, "text": ["THE RECKONING", "[Event]", "Lore", "The numbers come in.", "The meaning is different", "for everyone.", "Power", "Resolution: Resolve all", "pending provocations.", "No more spin."], "quad": 0, "n": 37}, {"page": 11, "n": 38, "text": ["THE EXIT", "[Ritual]", "Lore", "The loser must say", "the system works.", "Otherwise, it doesn't.", "Power", "Stabilize: If", "performed graciously,", "the game stabilizes.", "If refused, chaos", "ensues."], "quad": 1}, {"n": 39, "page": 11, "text": ["THE RETURN", "[Resurrection]", "Lore", "199", "You won't have Nixon to", "kick around anymore.", "(Wait, he's back).", "Power", "Second Act: Re-enter", "the game with a", "sympathy bonus."], "quad": 2}, {"quad": 3, "page": 11, "text": ["THE PEACE", "[Diplomacy]", "KayfaBINGO!", "Lore", "The hands are real.", "What happens next is", "just not written yet.", "Power", "Truce: Suspend all", "Monster cards for", "one round.", "GW", "Georg v. Westphalen"], "n": 40}, {"text": ["WEAPON: BLACKMAIL", "[Attack]", "Lore:", "\"I'm just sharing", "information. The", "information speaks", "for itselfiỊẠạẠạ", "Power:", "Recontextualize:", "Force an opponent to", "accept a negative", "interpretation of their", "past moves."], "page": 12, "n": 41, "quad": 0}, {"text": ["WEAPON: PRINCIPLE", "FEEDBACK", "[Sacrifice]", "Lore:", "\"I have said the thing.", "Now you have to live", "with it.\"", "Power:", "Truth Bomb: Sacrifice", "your position to shift", "the narrative 3 steps", "toward Truth."], "n": 42, "page": 12, "quad": 1}, {"text": ["WEAPON: DEBT", "[Utility]", "Lore:", "\"It's already done. I", "made some calls.\"", "Power:", "Auto-Resolve: Fix", "one problem instantly.", "No questions asked."], "n": 43, "page": 12, "quad": 2}, {"text": ["WEAPON: SCRIPT", "[Defense]", "Stay Fluffy!", "Lore:", "\"Stick to the grid.", "Don't answer the", "question asked.\"", "Power:", "Pre-Narration:", "Define the reality", "before it happens.", "TOP", "SECRET", "Georg v. Westohalen", "IGW"], "quad": 3, "n": 44, "page": 12}, {"n": 45, "page": 13, "text": ["THE FICTION", "[Passive]", "The performance of", "power is the source", "of power.", "